## 2. Deploying Backend to Vercel

The backend is configured with a serverless entrypoint (`backend/api/index.js`) and routing (`backend/vercel.json`).

### Step-by-Step in Vercel Dashboard:
1. On your Vercel Dashboard, click **Add New...** > **Project**.
2. Select your repository: `greathire-teamora-deployment-vercel` and click **Import**.
3. Configure Project Settings:
   - **Project Name**: e.g., `backend`
   - **Framework Preset**: Other
   - **Root Directory**: Click **Edit** and choose `backend`.
4. Open the **Environment Variables** section and add the following:

| Variable Name | Value / Description |
|---|---|
| `NODE_ENV` | `production` |
| `MONGODB_URI` | Your live MongoDB Atlas connection string (e.g. `mongodb+srv://greathire_backend:greathireisgreat@cluster0.d6kzzrb.mongodb.net/teamora?retryWrites=true&w=majority`) |
| `MONGODB_DB_NAME` | `teamora` |
| `JWT_SECRET` | A secure long random secret (e.g., `7fGS9kL!2mP&8vX1qW5zR0tY3uI6oO4pA9sD1fG8`) |
| `JWT_EXPIRES_IN` | `1d` |
| `JWT_REMEMBER_ME_EXPIRES_IN` | `30d` |
| `JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN` | `7d` |
| `JWT_REFRESH_REMEMBER_ME_EXPIRES_IN` | `60d` |
| `SEED_DEMO_DATA` | `true` |
| `SEED_USER_PASSWORD` | `password123` |
| `CLIENT_ORIGIN` | `https://*.vercel.app,https://frontend-sravans-projects-d52b9dc4.vercel.app,https://frontend-three-alpha-37.vercel.app` |
| `BREVO_API_KEY` | *(Optional)* Brevo API key for forgot-password reset emails |
| `BREVO_FROM_EMAIL` | `Teamora <greathire849@gmail.com>` |

5. Click **Deploy**.
6. When deployment finishes, verify it by visiting:
   ```text
   https://backend-sravans-projects-d52b9dc4.vercel.app/api/health
   ```
   You should see: `{"success":true,"message":"GreatHire Teamora API is running"}`.

